WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.889
In tutorial 1.7, you'll find your way
around Alaventra: your website's pages,

00:00:11.939 --> 00:00:14.487
your company's pages, and how to switch.

00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:20.042
First, the Website group in the sidebar
holds every page for one website,

00:00:20.092 --> 00:00:22.155
from Overview to Website settings.

00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:26.879
At the top of each page, you see
the website, whether it's verified,

00:00:26.929 --> 00:00:28.796
and whether weekly tracking is on.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.885
Further down, the Company group
has Run an analysis, Runs,

00:00:33.935 --> 00:00:38.054
Reports and Company settings.
Agencies also see Clients.

00:00:39.079 --> 00:00:42.414
And Write a page for a keyword
is always one click away.

00:00:44.579 --> 00:00:48.658
To switch company, or start a new one,
click the company name at the top.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:54.670
Click the website to switch to
another one, or to add a website.

00:00:57.058 --> 00:01:02.628
Your credit balance sits just below. At
the bottom, Guides explain, step by step,

00:01:02.678 --> 00:01:04.175
anything we ask you to do.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.730
Then close the guides, and click
your name for your account settings,

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:13.735
or to sign out. The icon beside Guides
switches between light and dark.

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:20.329
Now every page is one click away: your
website's results, your company's work,

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:21.970
and help whenever you need it.

00:01:22.966 --> 00:01:27.076
So, website pages, company pages,
the two switchers, and your credits,

00:01:27.126 --> 00:01:28.444
guides and account.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:34.280
Now you know your way around. Next,
join your team from an invitation,

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.170
in tutorial 1.8.
